{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00212",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 4.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Doctor, if you're free, we can start. I've got the numbers noted down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.5,
      "end_seconds": 8.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.45,
      "end_seconds": 18.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "It's swelling in my left calf, mostly. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.82,
      "end_seconds": 25.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 28.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I've had it since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.29,
      "end_seconds": 37.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.74,
      "end_seconds": 56.71,
      "duration_seconds": 18.97,
      "text": "I notice it more with standing. It just comes and goes. Raising the leg helps a bit. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I've had pain in that calf too, for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.05,
      "end_seconds": 60.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Have you had heaviness in the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.28,
      "end_seconds": 63.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Yeah. One week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.15,
      "end_seconds": 67.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.28,
      "end_seconds": 80.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.53,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.27,
      "end_seconds": 89.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any coughing up blood, breathlessness or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.3,
      "end_seconds": 94.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "No coughing up blood, breathlessness or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.19,
      "end_seconds": 98.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Have you had any fever or swelling in the other leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.37,
      "end_seconds": 104.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "No fever or swelling in the other leg, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.52,
      "end_seconds": 121.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.16,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.36,
      "end_seconds": 124.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Okay, you know, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 125.4,
      "end_seconds": 137.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.63,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. BMI works out to 28.6, pressure 134 over 84, respiratory rate 16, pulse is 115 beats a minute, temperature 37.1, weight 76 kilos, height 163 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.53,
      "end_seconds": 139.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.36,
      "end_seconds": 143.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.2,
      "end_seconds": 145.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.02,
      "end_seconds": 167.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Moving on to your background, any past medical history? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.09,
      "end_seconds": 176.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees, for two years. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.87,
      "end_seconds": 180.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.66,
      "end_seconds": 182.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.74,
      "end_seconds": 202.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.73,
      "end_seconds": 205.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "So, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.21,
      "end_seconds": 220.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.69,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.53,
      "end_seconds": 223.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.32,
      "end_seconds": 226.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Alright, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.7,
      "end_seconds": 229.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.9,
      "end_seconds": 231.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.09,
      "end_seconds": 234.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.36,
      "end_seconds": 240.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.01,
      "end_seconds": 250.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "Paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.35,
      "end_seconds": 256.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Just to be sure I've got this right, the paracetamol, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.22,
      "end_seconds": 259.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "650 milligrams, like I said."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.6,
      "end_seconds": 265.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.7,
      "end_seconds": 268.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.08,
      "end_seconds": 290.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "The left calf is bigger than the right, tender along the vein."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.5,
      "end_seconds": 304.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.74,
      "end_seconds": 307.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.44,
      "end_seconds": 320.61,
      "duration_seconds": 13.17,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is a possible deep vein clot. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Cellulitis is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.94,
      "end_seconds": 326.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.03,
      "end_seconds": 343.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.65,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible deep vein clot, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had swelling in your left calf, since this morning, and no coughing up blood or breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.23,
      "end_seconds": 345.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.72,
      "end_seconds": 349.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.66,
      "end_seconds": 352.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I mean, it's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.66,
      "end_seconds": 380.99,
      "duration_seconds": 27.33,
      "text": "I'm going to order a Doppler scan of the leg, for suspected DVT. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'd like to arrange a D-dimer blood test for suspected DVT. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Keep walking gently, and don't massage the calf. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.42,
      "end_seconds": 392.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you get chest pain or sudden breathlessness. I'd like to see you again in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.7,
      "end_seconds": 393.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.76,
      "end_seconds": 401.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.03,
      "end_seconds": 407.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.52,
      "end_seconds": 413.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.93,
      "end_seconds": 415.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}